{
 "id": "keepalive/ping-rescue-write-equals-read/5m",
 "description": "Turn 0 caches 6,000 tokens. A ping at minute 4 reads all 6,000. The request at minute 8 reads the same 6,000 and writes 6,000 new tokens. Without the ping the entry would have expired at minute 5, so the request would have written 6,000 + 6,000. The rescue is the smaller of what the ping read and what the request read: 6,000 x ($3.75 - $0.30) = +$0.02070, whatever the new turn wrote (design \u00a74.4 condition 4).",
